---
import astroLogo from "../assets/astro.svg";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import "../styles/styles.css";
---

<div id="container">
  <header>
    <a href="/casos-clinicos">
      <img
        src={astroLogo.src}
        width="115"
        height="48"
        alt="Astro Homepage"
      /></a
    >
    <nav>
      <a href="/casos-clinicos">Inicio</a>
      <a href="/sobre-mi">Sobre Mi</a>
      <a href="/servicios">Servicios</a>
    </nav>
    <button class="boton-cita">
      <a>Contáctanos</a>
    </button>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section id="hero">
      <article id="hero-text">
        <h1>
          Tu sonrisa nunca ha <br /> lucido <b>más hermosa.</b>
        </h1>
        <p>
          Recupera la confianza de sonreír con tratamientos personalizados y
          tecnología de vanguardia. En nuestra clínica, tu bienestar dental es
          nuestra prioridad.
        </p>
        <div id="hero-links">
          <button class="boton-hero"
            ><Icon name="mdi:calendar-clock" />Agendar cita
          </button>
          <button class="boton-hero"
            ><Icon name="mdi:arrow-right" />Conoce más</button
          >
        </div>
      </article>

      <section id="lower-buttons">
        <article class="hero-cta">
          <div class="icon-box">
            <img
              src={astroLogo.src}
              width="115"
              height="48"
              alt="Astro Homepage"
            />
            <Icon name="mdi:arrow-right" />
          </div>

          <div class="text-box">
            <h3>Agenda una cita</h3>
            <p>Elige el horario que mejor te convenga</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="hero-cta">
          <div class="icon-box">
            <img
              src={astroLogo.src}
              width="115"
              height="48"
              alt="Astro Homepage"
            />
            <Icon name="mdi:arrow-right" />
          </div>

          <div class="text-box">
            <h3>Conoce nuestros servicios</h3>
            <p>Descubre lo que podemos hacer por ti.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>
    </section>

    <section id="info">
      <div id="info-text">
        <h1>Especialidades diseñadas únicamente <br /> para tu bienestar.</h1>
        <p>
          Combinamos tecnología avanzada con un trato humano para ofrecerte
          resultados excepcionales en cada tratamiento.
        </p>
        <button>Ver Servicios</button>
      </div>

      <article id="cards-container">
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Diseños de sonrisa</h2>
          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Implantes dentales</h2>
          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Ortodoncia invisible</h2>
          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article id="stats-container">
        <div id="stats">
          <section id="stats-items-container">
            <div class="stat-item">
              <p>+1,500</p>
              <p>Clientes satisfechos</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
              <p>+25</p>
              <p>Años de experiencia</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
              <p>+3,000</p>
              <p>Casos atendidos</p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <img
            src={astroLogo.src}
            width="200"
            height="100"
            alt="Astro Homepage"
          />
        </div>

        <div id="stats-text">
          <h1>Pasión por la excelencia <br /> en salud dental</h1>
          <p>
            Nuestro compromiso es brindarte un diagnóstico preciso y soluciones
            duraderas, utilizando tecnología de punta para que tu paso por la
            clínica sea cómodo, seguro y transformador.
          </p>
          <p>
            Con más de dos décadas de trayectoria, el Dr. Juan Requena Alcántara
            se ha consolidado una formación internacional con un trato cercano y
            humano.
          </p>
          <button> Conoce más</button>
        </div>
      </article>

      <section id="contact-map">
        <div>
          <iframe
            src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d12631.720583863775!2d-4.9280177499999995!3d37.674349150000005!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0xd6d304ff47e5eb5%3A0x2541347cae15d3b5!2sMercadona!5e0!3m2!1sen!2ses!4v1768596711754!5m2!1sen!2ses"
            width="600"
            height="450"
            style="border:0;"
            allowfullscreen=""
            loading="lazy"
            referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>
        </div>

        <article id="faqs-container">
          <div id="faqs">
            <h2>¿Aun tienes preguntas?</h2>
            <p>
              ¡Estamos disponibles para responder cualquier duda que tengas!
              Respondemos dentro de las 24 horas.
            </p>
            <div>
              <Icon name="mdi:instagram" />
              <Icon name="mdi:facebook" />
              <Icon name="mdi:linkedin" />
            </div>
            <article id="hour-info">
              <div>
                <h4>Horario</h4>
                <p>Lunes - Viernes: 9:00 AM - 6:00 PM</p>
                <div>
                  <h4>Direccion</h4>
                  <p>2118 Thornridge Cir. Syracuse, Connecticut</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
          <div id="contact-form">
            <form>
              <input type="text" placeholder="Nombre Completo" />
              <input type="email" placeholder="Correo Electrónico" />
              <textarea placeholder="Tu Mensaje"></textarea>
              <button type="submit">Enviar Mensaje</button>
            </form>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>
      <section id="cta">
        <h2>¿Listo para transformar tu sonrisa?</h2>
        <button>Agendar una cita</button>
      </section>
    </section>
    <footer>
      <section id="footer-info">
        <article id="footer-info-left">
          <img
            src={astroLogo.src}
            width="115"
            height="48"
            alt="Astro Homepage"
          />
          <p>
            En Carlodent nos dedicamos a transformar vidas a través de sonrisas
            sanas y hermosas, brindando atención odontológica de primer nivel.
          </p>
          <div id="social-links">
            <Icon name="mdi:instagram" />
            <Icon name="mdi:facebook" />
            <Icon name="mdi:linkedin" />
          </div>
        </article>

        <article id="footer-info-right">
          <div class="footer-text-container">
            <h4>Navegación</h4>
            <a href="/">Inicio</a>
            <a href="/sobre-mi">Sobre Mi</a>
            <a href="/servicios">Servicios</a>
          </div>

          <div class="footer-text-container">
            <h4>Contacto</h4>
            <a href="#"><Icon name="mdi:location" />2118 Calle 1</a>
            <a href="#"><Icon name="mdi:phone" />+34 123 56 78 94</a>
            <a href="#"><Icon name="mdi:email" />carlodental@gmail.com</a>
          </div>

          <div class="footer-text-container">
            <h4>Horario</h4>
            <p>Lun-vie: 9:00 - 19:00</p>
            <p>Sábado: 9:00 - 19:00</p>
            <p>Domingo: <b>Cerrado</b></p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>

      <div class="user-policy">
        <p>Copyright © 2025 Dental Clinic. All rights reserved.</p>

        <p>User Terms & Conditions | Privacy Policy</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <style>
    #background {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      z-index: -1;
      filter: blur(100px);
    }

    [data-icon] {
      vertical-align: middle;
      font-size: 2em;
    }

    #container {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;

      h1 {
        font-family: "Helvetica", sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
      }

      p {
        font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
      }
    }

    header {
      width: 90%;
      height: 4em;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 2em;
      flex-grow: 1;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;

      a {
        font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
        font-size: 18px;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: black;
        padding: 0.25em;
      }

      a:nth-child(1) {
        border-bottom: 2px solid black;
        padding: 0.15em;
      }
    }
    .boton-cita {
      background-color: var(--dark-blue);
      border: none;
      padding: 15px 20px;
      border-radius: 25px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .boton-cita a {
      color: white;
      font-size: 18px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    main {
      height: 100%;
      width: 100%;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 42px;
      color: var(--dark-blue);
      margin-top: 0.25em;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    p {
      color: var(--dark-blue);
      font-size: 18px;
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 600px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    #lower-buttons {
      margin-top: 50px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 30em;
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: space-between;

      .icon-box {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: row;
        width: 90%;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
      }

      .text-box {
        text-align: left;
        padding: 0 1em;
        width: 80%;
        p {
          text-align: left;
          font-size: 14px;
        }
      }

      .hero-cta {
        display: flex;
        border-radius: 15px;
        background-color: #fafafa;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        height: 15em;
        width: 400px;
        gap: 1em;

        h3 {
          margin: 0;
        }

        p {
          font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
        }
      }
    }

    #hero {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: start;
      background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #8bdcff, #ffffff);
      height: auto;
      width: 100%;
    }

    #hero-text {
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 2em;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;

      p {
        font-size: 14px;
        width: 600px;
        font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
      }
    }

    #hero-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 15px;

      .boton-hero {
        background-color: var(--mid-blue);
        border: none;
        padding: 5px 15px;
        border-radius: 15px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-evenly;
        flex-direction: row;
        width: 200px;
        cursor: pointer;
        color: #fafafa;
      }

      .boton-hero:nth-child(2) {
        background-color: transparent;
        border: 2px solid var(--dark-blue);
        color: var(--dark-blue);
      }
    }

    #links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    #links a {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      color: #111827;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    #links a:hover {
      color: rgb(78, 80, 86);
    }

    #links a svg {
      height: 1em;
      margin-left: 8px;
    }

    #links a.button {
      color: white;
      background: linear-gradient(83.21deg, #3245ff 0%, #bc52ee 100%);
      box-shadow:
        inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12),
        inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24);
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    #links a.button:hover {
      color: rgb(230, 230, 230);
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    #info {
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 60px;
      padding-top: 50px;

      h2 {
        text-align: left;
      }

      p {
        color: black;
      }
    }

    #info-text {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      width: 80%;

      h1 {
        color: black;
        font-size: 32px;
      }

      p {
        text-align: left;
      }

      button {
        background-color: var(--mid-blue);
        border: none;
        padding: 5px 10px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        cursor: pointer;
        color: white;
        width: 150px;
        font-size: 18px;
        justify-self: end;
      }
    }

    #cards-container {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      gap: 20px;

      .card {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: end;
        background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffffff, #5b5757);
        padding: 40px 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        width: 300px;
        height: 350px;
        text-align: left;
        color: white;

        p {
          color: white;
          margin: 0;
          text-align: left;
        }
      }

      h3 {
        margin-top: 0;
      }
    }

    #stats-container {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      gap: 80px;
    }

    #stats {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .stat-item {
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: var(--cian);

      p:first-child {
        font-size: 36px;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin: 0;
      }
    }
    #stats-items-container {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    #stats-text {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
      width: 500px;

      h1 {
        color: black;
        text-align: left;
      }

      p {
        text-align: left;
      }

      button {
        background-color: var(--mid-blue);
        border: none;
        padding: 5px 10px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        cursor: pointer;
        color: white;
        width: 180px;
        font-size: 18px;
        justify-self: end;
      }
    }

    #contact-map {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
    }

    #faqs-container {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      gap: 50px;
      background-color: var(--cian);
      padding: 50px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    #faqs {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
      text-align: left;
      color: var(--dark-blue);

      h2 {
        width: 250px;
        margin: 0;
      }

      p {
        color: var(--dark-blue);
        text-align: left;
        margin-bottom: 0;
        font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
      }
    }

    #hour-info {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      color: var(--dark-blue);

      h4 {
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
        font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
      }

      p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
    }

    #contact-form {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;

      form {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 15px;
      }

      input,
      textarea {
        font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
        padding: 10px;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      button {
        background-color: var(--mid-blue);
        border: none;
        padding: 10px;
        border-radius: 15px;
        cursor: pointer;
        color: white;
        font-size: 18px;
      }
    }

    #cta {
      background-image: linear-gradient(to left, var(--mid-blue), var(--cian));
      width: 100%;
      padding: 40px 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 100px;

      h2 {
        color: var(--dark-blue);
        margin: 0;
      }

      button {
        background-color: var(--dark-blue);
        border: none;
        padding: 15px 15px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        cursor: pointer;
        color: white;
        font-size: 18px;
      }
    }

    footer {
      background-color: var(--dark-blue);
      color: white;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 100%;
      height: 360px;
      align-items: center;

      h4,
      p,
      a {
        font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
      }
    }

    #footer-info {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 50px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      width: 85%;

      p {
        color: white;
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 14px;
        text-align: left;
      }
    }

    #footer-info-left {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
      width: 30%;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    #footer-info-right {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 80px;
      width: 70%;

      [data-icon] {
        font-size: 1em;
      }

      .footer-text-container {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 10px;
        width: 20%;

        h4 {
          margin: 0;
        }

        a {
          color: white;
          text-decoration: none;
          font-size: 14px;
          width: 190px;
          display: flex;
          gap: 5px;
          align-items: center;
        }

        a:hover {
          text-decoration: underline;
        }
      }
    }

    .user-policy {
      border-top: 2px solid white;
      padding-top: 20px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      width: 85%;
      justify-content: space-between;
      p {
        font-size: 12px;
        margin: 0;
        color: white;
      }
    }

    #news {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 16px;
      right: 16px;
      max-width: 300px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background 0.2s;
      backdrop-filter: blur(50px);
    }

    #news:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    }

    @media screen and (max-height: 368px) {
      #news {
        display: none;
      }
    }

    @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
      #container {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      #hero {
        display: block;
        padding-top: 10%;
      }

      #links {
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      #links a.button {
        padding: 14px 18px;
      }

      #news {
        right: 16px;
        left: 16px;
        bottom: 2.5rem;
        max-width: 100%;
      }

      h1 {
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
    }
  </style>
</div>
